@startuml budget-namespace-states
' Per-namespace budget state for one ModelProvider and one period, as
' reported in status.budgetUsage[].state. Derived from percentUsed against
' perNamespaceUSD and the policy ladder (internal/controller/
' modelprovider_budget.go). Source of truth: docs/src/resources/modelprovider.md
!include _style.puml

state "Normal" as Normal
state "Throttled" as Throttled
state "Blocked" as Blocked

[*] --> Normal : period opens

Normal --> Throttled : spend crosses a degrade policy's atPercent
Normal --> Blocked : spend crosses a block policy's atPercent
Throttled --> Blocked : spend crosses a block policy's atPercent

Blocked --> Normal : period rollover, or a spec edit
Throttled --> Normal : period rollover, or a spec edit
@enduml
